---
import CommonPage from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'

const title = '游戏：三英戏吕布与贪吃蛇'
const description =
  '浏览器里直接开玩的小游戏：三英戏吕布是汉字水墨风的合成塔防对战，征兵抽字、同类合成、拼字唤将；贪吃蛇是 26×26 棋盘的经典重制。无需注册，打开即玩。'
---

<CommonPage title="游戏" meta={{ title, description }}>
  <div class="games">
    <p class="answer">
      写码间隙活动一下手指：这里放了两个<strong>打开即玩</strong>的浏览器小游戏，不注册、不下载，
      进度只存在你自己的浏览器里。
    </p>

    <section class="list" aria-label="游戏列表">
      <article class="card">
        <a class="card-link" href="/games/sanying" aria-label="打开三英戏吕布"></a>
        <div class="no">01</div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="row">
            <h2>三英戏吕布 · 文字塔防</h2>
            <span class="badge">新上线</span>
          </div>
          <p>
            汉字水墨风的合成塔防对战。花馒头征兵抽字牌，同种同级拖到一起升级；凑齐姓名横向相邻摆放唤出武将，
            刀近战、枪中程、弓远程，点武将还能看攻击范围与攻速。每局地图与石堆随机生成，守住阿斗即为胜。
          </p>
          <div class="tags"><span>汉字水墨</span><span>合成塔防</span><span>单机对战</span><span>随机地图</span></div>
          <span class="go">开始游戏 <span class="arr">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <a class="card-link" href="/games/snake" aria-label="打开贪吃蛇"></a>
        <div class="no">02</div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="row">
            <h2>贪吃蛇 · Snake</h2>
            <span class="badge">经典重制</span>
          </div>
          <p>
            26×26 棋盘铺满苹果，红苹果 +1、金苹果 +3、紫色毒苹果吃到即结束。方向键 / WASD 控制，空格暂停，
            手机上滑动棋盘或点方向键；无敌模式与本地最高分也都备好了。
          </p>
          <div class="tags"><span>Canvas</span><span>键盘 / 触屏</span><span>WebAudio</span><span>本地最高分</span></div>
          <span class="go">开始游戏 <span class="arr">→</span></span>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p class="note">
      两个游戏都是纯前端实现，逻辑在浏览器本地运行；<strong>切换设备不会同步存档</strong>，武器、最高分等记录保存在当前浏览器。
    </p>
  </div>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'ItemList',
    name: '游戏',
    url: 'https://blog.halo26812.eu.org/games',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: '三英戏吕布 · 文字塔防', url: 'https://blog.halo26812.eu.org/games/sanying' },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: '贪吃蛇 · Snake', url: 'https://blog.halo26812.eu.org/games/snake' }
    ]
  })} />

  <style>
    .games { line-height: 1.8; }
    .games .answer {
      border-left: 3px solid hsl(var(--primary) / 0.55);
      padding-left: 1rem;
      margin: 1rem 0 1.8rem;
      color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    }
    .games .answer strong { color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .games .list { display: grid; gap: 14px; }
    .games .card {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 46px 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: hsl(var(--card));
      transition: border-color 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
    }
    .games .card:hover {
      border-color: hsl(var(--primary) / 0.5);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .games .card-link { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; }
    .games .no {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: hsl(var(--primary));
      padding-top: 4px;
    }
    .games .row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .games h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    }
    .games .badge {
      padding: 1px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: hsl(var(--background));
      background: hsl(var(--primary));
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .games p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    }
    .games .tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }
    .games .tags span {
      padding: 2px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
      background: hsl(var(--muted) / 0.6);
    }
    .games .go {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: hsl(var(--primary));
    }
    .games .arr { display: inline-block; transition: transform 0.18s ease; }
    .games .card:hover .arr { transform: translateX(4px); }
    .games .note {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border));
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    }
    .games .note strong { color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .games .card, .games .arr { transition: none; }
    }
  </style>
</CommonPage>
